message.reasoning:
Need count distinct property keys across properties maps of purchase events on 2024-03-01, combining mapKeys with ARRAY JOIN. Single number.

```sql
SELECT count(DISTINCT key) FROM (SELECT mapKeys(properties) AS keys FROM events WHERE event_type = 'purchase' AND toDate(timestamp) = '2024-03-01') ARRAY JOIN keys AS key;
```

Or more directly: SELECT countDistinct(k) FROM events ARRAY JOIN mapKeys(properties) AS k WHERE event_type='purchase' AND toDate(timestamp)=toDate('2024-03-01');

That works in ClickHouse.

